msgid "The string `s3` will contain `Hello, world!`. The reason `s1` is no longer valid after the addition, and the reason we used a reference to `s2`, has to do with the signature of the method that’s called when we use the `+` operator. The `+` operator uses the `add` method, whose signature looks something like this:"
