msgstr "Quando executamos esses testes com `cargo test`, vamos ver a seguinte saída:"

#: src/ch11-02-running-tests.md
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"$ cargo test\n"
"   Compiling silly-function v0.1.0 (file:///projects/silly-function)\n"
"    Finished `test` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.58s\n"
